description	"Battle Droid (Demolition)

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Pistol (1)
- E-5 Blaster Rifle (3)
- E-60R Rocket Launcher
-- 2 Thermal Det Rockets
- 3 Frag Grenades

^8Attributes:
- Blast Armour
- Battery Recharge (2)
- Close Combat Training (1)

B1 battle droids were battle droids that made up the backbone of the Trade Federation Droid Army and the Separatist Droid Army. It was the successor of the hunter-killer droid."